WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
So you mention your dad's [Army] Corps of Engineers experience.

2
00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:09.440
Did the Corps of Engineers at the time, did they realize that what they were doing would have effects like we're seeing today?

3
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.880
Or were they ignorant?

4
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.540
They were clearly not ignorant.

5
00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:26.500
Most of the projects that were done were to help with coastal erosion and to build back certain areas of land that were being depleted by coastal erosion.

6
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:34.480
There's a Davis Crevasse project that diverts water from the river into marshlands,

7
00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:46.300
which actually takes the mud deposits from the river water and it flows into the marshland as silt and it backfills the marsh which actually helps the marsh.

8
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:53.580
There's also another one down in Caernarvon which is around the Violet area and it does the same thing:

9
00:00:53.580 --> 00:01:00.540
it backfills silt deposits from the Mississippi River, placing sand in the marsh and backfilling.

10
00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:07.940
So it does help and they have several projects like that in the river that have [been] done to help with coastal erosion.

11
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:10.520
You've had a long family history connection to the river.

12
00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:14.760
In your family's experience, has there been a feeling that this is speeding up or getting worse?

13
00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:17.660
Or has it always been kind of a constant issue?

14
00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:23.620
It's always been a constant battle to be proactive to help it.

15
00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:31.940
I don't know that they can do anything to beat Mother Nature, because Mother Nature is just amazing.

16
00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:41.420
You look at the way Hurricane Katrina changed the shoreline of the whole southern part of the United States from the edge of,

17
00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.020
I would say, probably Florida to Texas.

18
00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:49.800
All the way up and down that coastline there have been major changes in the coastline.

19
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:52.760
She just made such a change.

20
00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:55.020
It really devastated the marsh areas.
